gametitle=Grand Theft Auto III (NTSC-U SLUS-20062 / CRC 5E115FB6)
comment=Work in progress. Adds an in-game map with location icons using the original GTA III map assets.
comment=Press Start + Select to open or close the map menu. While the map menu is open, press Cross to hide or show the location icons.
comment=Release Start and Select before toggling the map again.
comment=Cold boot required. Current build is intended for a 4:3 display.
author=Zeroable
[GTA-PS2-Modern-Controls\Map Toggle - Press Start and Select WIP]
